+*   UnitySplats is a modified and substantially extended fork of `wuyize25/gsplat-unity` [S1, unofficial].
+*   The method was developed to support volume occlusion and lighting for 3DGS in Unity, addressing the lack of native volumetric lighting in standard 3DGS renderers [S1, unofficial].
